\ Regression: in --interpreter-fallback=false mode, a program that reaches
\ only plain native primitives must build cleanly. When the AOT resolver
\ dropped `native_fn_ptr` for non-generic natives, callers like
\ `print-line` -> `>bytes` / `stream-write` / `stream-flush` miscompiled
\ as compound-uncompiled emissions and the strict build rejected them.
\ Routing those native call sites through `jitNativeWordCall` by word_id
\ makes the build succeed.
"ok" print-line
